It is a sunny morning in May.
I ride my bicycle to the office.
I arrive at the office and see Jonas.
Our team lead Katrin comes over to us.
"Good morning, you two," she says.
"Please come into the meeting room briefly."
We sit down at the table.
"We have a new project," Katrin says.
"The client signed the contract yesterday."
Jonas nods in satisfaction.
"I have been the team lead here for three years," Katrin says.
"But this is our most important client."
She looks at me and smiles.
"Maya, you are working directly with us on this project."
"We need a good software engineer."
"I am really looking forward to the collaboration," I answer.
Jonas opens his laptop.
"Let's get started then!" he says, motivated.
